=== K3 elliptic fibration interpretation ===
V' is K3 with rho >= 10 (per V-FALTINGS-ATTACK.md).
V' admits 3 obvious elliptic fibrations (one per face).
Pick fibration pi_b: V' -> P^1_b with general fiber elliptic in (c, d, e, f).
Generator (1, q, c) of an Euler brick at fixed b=q lies on a fiber.
Section of V' -> P^1_b: t -> (a(t), q=t, c(t), d(t), e(t), f(t)) with rational c, d, e, f.

The c-map is the inversion: given fiber t = q with a rational point,
we recover c = c-value of that point, giving a point on a different fiber.
Generically these are unrelated; but on the RANK-JUMP locus they relate.

